  "description": "An existing Snowball Edge customer must import hundreds of terabytes to S3, but the available network link is too slow. Which option uses physically shipped devices?",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>문제 풀이</span></nav><section class=\"quiz-page\"><div class=\"quiz-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">QUESTION 051</p><h1>문제 풀이</h1></div><strong>51 / 108</strong></div><div class=\"quiz-progress\" aria-label=\"51번째 문제\"><span style=\"width:47%\"></span></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q051\" data-question=\"Q051\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q051</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An existing Snowball Edge customer must import hundreds of terabytes to S3, but the available network link is too slow. Which option uses physically shipped devices?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q051\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Snowball Edge Storage Optimized</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q051\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon ElastiCache</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q051\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q051\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A VPC endpoint</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · 기존 고객은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/\">Snowball Edge</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/#storage-optimized\">Storage Optimized</a> 장치를 배송받아 데이터를 복사하고 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span>로 반송해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>로 가져올 수 있다. 신규 고객에게는 장치 주문이 제공되지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/\">DataSync / Snow Family</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/\">Snowball Edge</a></div></article><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"문제 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q050/\">이전 문제 <b>Q050</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q052/\">다음 문제 <b>Q052</b></a></span></nav><p class=\"save-note\">선택과 채점 결과는 이 브라우저에 자동 저장됩니다.</p></section>"
}
